OL,3,AIsraeli exit polls suggest no clear
OL,4,Awinner with Eisenkot's bloc just ahead
OL,5,Aof Netanyahu
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsraeli exit polls suggest Gadi
OL,8,FEisenkot's bloc has won the largest
OL,9,Fnumber of seats in the general election
OL,10,Fbut has fallen short of a majority
OL,12,FEisenkot leads the newly formed Yashar
OL,13,Fparty and is the main figure in the
OL,14,F"change bloc", a group of opposition
OL,15,Fparties with the shared goal of ousting
OL,16,FBenjamin Netanyahu
OL,18,FThe exit polls also suggest Netanyahu's
OL,19,FLikud party is set to be the biggest
OL,20,Fsingle party in the Israeli parliament
OL,21,F- watch a BBC News live special above
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
