OL,3,AIsraeli exit polls suggest no clear
OL,4,Awinner with Eisenkot's bloc just ahead
OL,5,Aof Netanyahu
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsraeli elections can be decided by
OL,8,Fjust a handful of seats and exit polls
OL,9,Fhave been wrong in the past
OL,11,FOfficial results will start being
OL,12,Freleased from midnight local time
OL,13,F(22:00 GMT), but counting could take
OL,14,Fdays
OL,16,FAll 120 seats in the Knesset, Israel's
OL,17,Fparliament, are up for grabs, but no
OL,18,Fparty has ever won a majority and in
OL,19,Fthe past governments have been made up
OL,20,Fof coalitions
